msgstr "Xa uhlola Imida, ukuba Umthombo weDatha ubuyisa iDatha Engaziwayo ('U'), jonga ixabiso njenge-zero kuhlolwo loMda. Unokuvumela kwakhona ukuba lo mbandela ulogwe."

