msgstr "Okusisiseko kwe-ifHighSpeed eNgenanto"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Xa ubala Imida yeNtetho, ukuba i-ifHighSpeed ne-ifSpeed zibuya zingu-zero, sebenzisa le setingi ye-ifHighSpeed ilandelayo endaweni yoko. I-ifHighSpeed emiselweyo iya kuba ngu-10000 kwiindawo zonxibelelwano ze-10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Izikhethwa Zezaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Cima Izaziso Zakudala"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kucima ii-Alert eziDala kuyo yonke iMida. Ii-Alert eziDala zichazwa njengazo naziphi na ii-Alert ze-Imeyile eziKhethekileyo ezingayamaniswanga noLuhlu lweZaziso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Isaziso soMda esineTempleyiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethiwe, xa usenza Itempleyiti yoMda, Iisetingi zayo zeZaziso ziya kuba phantsi kweTempleyiti yoMda ngokungagqibekanga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Vula ukuQhutywa kweMiyalelo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kuvula isakhono sokuphumeza imiyalelo kwiziganeko zokwaphulwa koMda nezokubuyiselwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Vula iSaziso ngokwe-Thold nganye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kuvula isakhono sokugcina imizimba ye-Imeyile elungiselelweyo yeMida."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Vula uMtya weZaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kutshintsha i-Thold ekwenzeni iSaziso sangaphakathi (inline) iye ekusebenziseni i-Notification Daemon, okanye izaziso ezenziwa ngaphandle kwebhendi yi-Poller yeZaziso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Vula ukuThumela ii-imeyile ze-Alert kwiintlu zeZaziso zeSilumkiso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi ukuba ufuna abamkeli boLuhlu lweZaziso zeSilumkiso bafumane ii-Imeyile ze-Alert ukongeza kubamkeli boluhlu lweZaziso ze-Alert. Oku kuyasebenza xa iZaziso zeSilumkiso zisiya kuBalawuli kwaye iZaziso ze-Alert zisiya kuLawulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "I-Daemon yoMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Vula i-Daemon yoMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kuvula ukusetyenziswa kwe-daemon yoMda ezinikeleyo. Oku kunokusetyenziswa ukunyusa ukusebenza kwenkqubo kunye/okanye ukusasaza ukubeka iliso koMda kwiseva eyahlukileyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Nyanzela i-Debug yeDaemon yoMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Ukuphawula le bhokisi kuya kuvula ulungiso lweempazamo lwe-Threshold Daemon xa isebenza ukusuka kwi-SystemD okanye ngomgca wemiyalelo. Olu tshintsho luyasebenza kwangoko kwaye luya kuqalisa ngokukhawuleza nje ukuba kuqale isingqisho soMda esilandelayo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindeka kweSaziso xa i-Daemon iphantsi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Ukuba i-Thold Daemon ifunyanwa ingasebenzi, thumela isaziso se-imeyile ngeli xesha eliphindaphindwayo."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Rhoqo ngeyure e-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Imisonto ye-Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Inani lemisonto ye-daemon eliza kusingathwa yi-Daemon yoMda."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Inkqubo"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Iinkqubo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa kweeLog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Faka kwiLogi uKwaphulwa koMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Vula ukurekhoda kwakho konke ukusilela koMda kwi-Cacti Log."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Bonisa uMthombo weDatha kwiLogi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Bonisa igama loMthombo weDatha kwiLogi ukuba alikho."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Faka kwiLogi uTshintsho loMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Vula ukurekhoda kwezinto zonke ezitshintshwayo zoMda kwi-Cacti Log."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Ilogi ye-Debug"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Vula ukurekhoda kwemiyalezo yokulungisa iimpazamo ngoMda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Ugcino lweLogi yeSaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Gcina iilogi zeMida eli nani leentsuku."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Faka kwiLogi isenzo esithi Thatha iDatha Engaziwayo njengeQanda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Xa i-'Thatha iDatha eNgaziwayo njengeZiro' ivuliwe, bhala kwilog xa isenzeka"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi ze-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "I-Syslog Ivuliwe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethiwe, xa usenza Umda omtsha, ngokungagqibekanga iziganeko ezitsha zoMda ziya kuthunyelwa kwi-syslog yakho yengingqi. Le setingi siseto lwangaphambili. Iisetingi zoMda zilungisa ulawulo lokwenyani lwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Ukubaluleka/Inqanaba elingagqibekanga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Eli liNqanaba lokuQala/iNqanaba elingagqibekanga eliza kusetyenziswa yi-Thold ukuthumela imiyalezo ye-syslog. Le setingi iyisetingi ebekwe kwangaphambili. Iisetingi zoMda zibeka ulawulo lokwenene lwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "I-Facility engagqibekanga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Le yi-Facility engagqibekanga eza kusetyenziswa yi-Thold ukuthumela imiyalezo ye-syslog. Le setingi iyisetingi ebekwe kwangaphambili. Iisetingi zoMda zibeka ulawulo lokwenene lwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Iisetingi zangaphambili zeSaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Ukukhululwa kwempela-veki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Ukuba oku kukhethiwe, i-Thold ayiyi kusebenza ngeempelaveki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Inani lokuvuselela elingagqibekanga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Inani elingagqibekanga lamaxesha alandelelanayo apho uMthombo weDatha kufuneka wophule uMda ukuze kuphakanyiswe isilumkiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Ukulumkisa kwakhona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Phinda iSaziso emva kwenani elimiselweyo lemijikelo ye-Poller."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Iisetingi eziQalisiweyo zeSiseko"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Uluhlu lweXesha leSiseko oluSisigxina"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Eli lixabiso elingagqibekanga elisetyenziswa ekudaleni Imida okanye iitempleyiti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Inani lokuVusa kweSiseko"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Inani elingagqibekanga lamaxesha alandelelanayo apho uMthombo weDatha kufuneka wophule uMda weSiseko obaliweyo ukuze kuphakanyiswe isilumkiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Ipesenti yokuPhambuka kweSiseko"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zeZaziso ze-SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Izaziso ze-SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Imiyalezo yobume boMda (izaziso/ii-trap) iya kuthunyelwa kubamkeli bezaziso ze-SNMP. Oku kuquka ii-Alert, iZilumkiso kunye nee-trap zokuBuyisela ngokungagqibekanga. Qaphela: Eli nqaku lifuna i-plugin ye-Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Cima Izaziso zeSilumkiso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Ukuba oku kukhethiwe, Umda awuyi kuthumela isaziso xa Umda wesilumkiso uphulwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Cima Izaziso zokuBuyiselwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Ukuba oku kukhethiwe, Umda awuyi kuthumela isaziso xa Umda ubuyele kubume obuqhelekileyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zokuthumela i-Imeyile"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Thumela ii-imeyile ngoNgxamiseko oPhambili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Ikuvumela ukuba usete ii-imeyile ezinokubaluleka okungxamisekileyo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Thumela iZilumkiso njengoMbhalo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethiwe, oku kuya kubangela ukuba zonke ii-Alert zithunyelwe njengee-imeyile zombhalo nje ezingenagrafu. Okungagqibekanga zii-imeyile ze-HTML ezinegrafu efakwe kwi-imeyile."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Thumela I-imeyile ngokwahlukeneyo kwidilesi nganye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethiwe, oku kuya kubangela ukuba zonke ii-imeyile zithunyelwe ngokwahlukeneyo kwidilesi nganye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Idilesi ye-Imeyile yoMthumeli"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Le yidilesi ye-Imeyile Umda oza kubonakala uvela kuyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Igama loMthumeli"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Eli ligama lokwenene Umda oza kubonakala uvela kulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zeSaziso seSixhobo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Vula iZaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Vula isaziso sehosti efileyo/echachayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Isaziso se-imeyile esinye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Ixhaswa kuLuhlu lweZaziso noMgcini weZaziso kuphela.  Ukuba kukho iZaziso zeSixhobo esiPhantsi kumjikelo omnye wokuqhuba.  Thumela I-imeyile enye kuphela kubamkeli boLuhlu lweZaziso kuzo zonke Izixhobo."

#: includes/settings.php
