#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umyalelo wokuVusa oPhezulu"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ukuba icwangcisiwe, kwaye ukuba Umda oPhezulu uphulwe, lo myalelo uya kuqhutywa. Nceda ufake umyalelo osebenzayo. Ukongeza, kukho iithegi zokutshintshiselana ezininzi ezikhoyo ezinokusetyenziswa ukudlulisela ulwazi ukusuka kuMda ukuya kwiskripthi. Unokwenza oku njengeengxoxo kumgca womyalelo, okanye ngokukhethekileyo, kwimeko yokusebenza yeskripthi. Onke amaxabiso okutshintshiselana aya kuvela kwimeko yeskripthi enesimaphambili esingu-THOLD_. Ngoko ke, umzekelo u-CURRENTVALUE uya kuba ngu-THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, njalo njalo. Iindidi eziguqukayo ziquka: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Okokugqibela, utshintshiselwano lweHosti, uMbuzo weDatha kunye noNgeniso lweDatha lungenziwa. Umzekelo, ukuba unedatha eyenzelwe wena yongeniso lwedatha ebizwa ngokuba yi-pending, ukwenza utshintshiselwano sebenzisa |pending|. KuMbuzo weDatha, kunye notshintshiselwano lweHosti sebenzisa iindlela ze-Cacti ezingu-|query_xxxx|, kunye no-|host_xxxx| ngokulandelelana."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umyalelo woQaliso oPhantsi"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ukuba icwangcisiwe, kwaye ukuba Umda oPhantsi uphulwe, lo myalelo uya kuqhutywa. Nceda ufake umyalelo osebenzayo. Ukongeza, kukho iithegi zokutshintshiselana ezininzi ezikhoyo ezinokusetyenziswa ukudlulisela ulwazi ukusuka kuMda ukuya kwiskripthi. Unokwenza oku njengeengxoxo kumgca womyalelo, okanye ngokukhethekileyo, kwimeko yokusebenza yeskripthi. Onke amaxabiso okutshintshiselana aya kuvela kwimeko yeskripthi enesimaphambili esingu-THOLD_. Ngoko ke, umzekelo u-CURRENTVALUE uya kuba ngu-THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, njalo njalo. Iindidi eziguqukayo ziquka: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Okokugqibela, utshintshiselwano lweHosti, uMbuzo weDatha kunye noNgeniso lweDatha lungenziwa. Umzekelo, ukuba unedatha eyenzelwe wena yongeniso lwedatha ebizwa ngokuba yi-pending, ukwenza utshintshiselwano sebenzisa |pending|. KuMbuzo weDatha, kunye notshintshiselwano lweHosti sebenzisa iindlela ze-Cacti ezingu-|query_xxxx|, kunye no-|host_xxxx| ngokulandelelana."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umyalelo Wokuvuselela Oqhelekileyo"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ukuba icwangcisiwe, xa i-thold ibuyela kwixabiso eliqhelekileyo, lo myalelo uya kuqhutywa. Nceda ufake umyalelo osebenzayo. Ukongeza, kukho iithegi zokutshintshiselana ezininzi ezikhoyo ezinokusetyenziswa ukudlulisela ulwazi ukusuka kuMda ukuya kwiskripthi. Unokwenza oku njengeengxoxo kumgca womyalelo, okanye ngokukhethekileyo, kwimeko yokusebenza yeskripthi. Onke amaxabiso okutshintshiselana aya kuvela kwimeko yeskripthi enesimaphambili esingu-THOLD_. Ngoko ke, umzekelo u-CURRENTVALUE uya kuba ngu-THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, njalo njalo. Iindidi eziguqukayo ziquka: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Okokugqibela, utshintshiselwano lweHosti, uMbuzo weDatha kunye noNgeniso lweDatha lungenziwa. Umzekelo, ukuba unedatha eyenzelwe wena yongeniso lwedatha ebizwa ngokuba yi-pending, ukwenza utshintshiselwano sebenzisa |pending|. KuMbuzo weDatha, kunye notshintshiselwano lweHosti sebenzisa iindlela ze-Cacti ezingu-|query_xxxx|, kunye no-|host_xxxx| ngokulandelelana."

