msgstr "Lo ngumyalezo oza kuboniswa phezulu kwazo zonke izaziso zokubuyiselwa koMda (Ubuninzi beempawu ezili-1024). I-HTML ivumelekile, kodwa iya kususwa kwii-imeyile ezinesicatshulwa kuphela. Kukho iithegi zokutshintshisa eziliqela eziqhelekileyo ezinokusetyenziswa eziquka:<br>&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062  &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062  &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060NOTES&#062 &#060DNOTES&#062"

